{"id":"a2-u02","level":"a2","order":2,"title":{"en":"Negotiation","fr":"La négociation","es":"La negociación","ar":"التفاوض"},"tip":{"en":"In a negotiation, soften refusals and signal concessions: \"We could consider..., provided that...\". Conditional forms keep the tone polite but firm.","fr":"Dans une négociation, adoucissez vos refus et annoncez vos concessions : « Nous pourrions envisager..., à condition que... ». Le conditionnel garde un ton poli mais ferme.","es":"En una negociación, suaviza los rechazos y anuncia las concesiones: «Podríamos considerar..., siempre que...». El condicional mantiene un tono cortés pero firme.","ar":"في التفاوض، خفف صيغة الرفض وأعلن عن تنازلاتك: «يمكننا النظر في...، شريطة أن...». يحافظ أسلوب الشرط على نبرة مهذبة وحازمة."},"words":48,"lessons":[{"id":"a2-u02-l1","type":"learn","order":1,"title":{"en":"negotiation, offer, counteroffer","fr":"négociation, offre, contre-offre","es":"negociación, oferta, contraoferta","ar":"مفاوضات، عرض، عرض مضاد"},"count":11},{"id":"a2-u02-l2","type":"learn","order":2,"title":{"en":"contract, clause, terms","fr":"contrat, clause, conditions","es":"contrato, cláusula, condiciones","ar":"عقد، بند، شروط"},"count":10},{"id":"a2-u02-l3","type":"learn","order":3,"title":{"en":"margin, deal, party","fr":"marge, marché, partie","es":"margen, trato, parte","ar":"هامش الربح، صفقة، طرف"},"count":11},{"id":"a2-u02-l4","type":"learn","order":4,"title":{"en":"bottom line, to bargain, to concede","fr":"seuil minimal, marchander, concéder","es":"límite mínimo, regatear, conceder","ar":"الحد الأدنى، يساوم، يتنازل"},"count":10},{"id":"a2-u02-l5","type":"learn","order":5,"title":{"en":"to accept, to sign, to renew","fr":"accepter, signer, renouveler","es":"aceptar, firmar, renovar","ar":"يقبل، يوقع، يجدد"},"count":11},{"id":"a2-u02-l6","type":"learn","order":6,"title":{"en":"to withdraw, flexible, firm","fr":"se retirer, flexible, ferme","es":"retirarse, flexible, firme","ar":"ينسحب، مرن، حازم"},"count":10},{"id":"a2-u02-l7","type":"learn","order":7,"title":{"en":"fair, deadlock, win-win","fr":"équitable, impasse, gagnant-gagnant","es":"equitativo, punto muerto, beneficioso para ambos","ar":"عادل، طريق مسدود، مربح للطرفين"},"count":11},{"id":"a2-u02-l8","type":"learn","order":8,"title":{"en":"delivery, payment, invoice","fr":"livraison, paiement, facture","es":"entrega, pago, factura","ar":"تسليم، دفع، فاتورة"},"count":10},{"id":"a2-u02-l9","type":"learn","order":9,"title":{"en":"expiry date, exclusivity, confidentiality","fr":"date d'expiration, exclusivité, confidentialité","es":"fecha de vencimiento, exclusividad, confidencialidad","ar":"تاريخ الانتهاء، حصرية، السرية"},"count":10},{"id":"a2-u02-l10","type":"learn","order":10,"title":{"en":"amendment, draft, in exchange for","fr":"avenant, projet, en échange de","es":"enmienda, borrador, a cambio de","ar":"تعديل، مسودة، مقابل"},"count":9},{"id":"a2-u02-l11","type":"story","order":11,"title":{"en":"Conversation","fr":"Conversation","es":"Conversación","ar":"محادثة"},"count":10},{"id":"a2-u02-l12","type":"review","order":12,"title":{"en":"Unit review","fr":"Révision de l'unité","es":"Repaso de la unidad","ar":"مراجعة الوحدة"},"count":9}]}
